  "description": "Field-level encryption for Entity Framework Core. AES-GCM authenticated encryption, key rotation, blind-index equality lookups, exact Contains/StartsWith/EndsWith search and in-application sorting on encrypted columns, a query guard that throws instead of returning wrong results, verified batch re-encryption (CBC to GCM, key rotation), convention-based AutoEncryption, ML PII classifier, Crypto Sentinel decryption-anomaly monitoring, email/webhook alerting and DPDP/GDPR compliance reports.",
  "iconFile": "Icon.png",
